		{
			"text": "* Parent Node: A node that is an immediate predecessor of another node. \n  - Example: 35 is the parent of 3 and 6.\n* Subtree:  A node and all its descendants form a subtree.\n* Sibling: Nodes that share the same parent. \n  - Example: 1 and 10 are siblings, and 5 and 7 are siblings.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
