			"updated": 1783535543350,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "* Ancestor: Any node on the path from the root to a given node \n  (excluding the node itself). \n  - Example: 15 and 35 are ancestors of 10.\n* Descendant: A node x is a descendant of another node y if y is an ancestor of x.\n  - Example: 1, 10, and 6 are descendants of 35.",
			"rawText": "* Ancestor: Any node on the path from the root to a given node \n  (excluding the node itself). \n  - Example: 15 and 35 are ancestors of 10.\n* Descendant: A node x is a descendant of another node y if y is an ancestor of x.\n  - Example: 1, 10, and 6 are descendants of 35.",
