			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Since there is no order in a General Tree (unlike a BST), we have no way to \"skip\" branches.\nWe must search recursively: check the current node, then check every child.",
			"rawText": "Since there is no order in a General Tree (unlike a BST), we have no way to \"skip\" branches. We must search recursively: check the current node, then check every child.",
