		{
			"id": "oOMZGaxx",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2812.767832576492,
			"y": 5025.689161636954,
			"width": 923.998779296875,
			"height": 125,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1v",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1131509252,
			"version": 593,
			"versionNonce": 1939388732,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: If deleting an internal node also deletes all its descendants, you must\ntraverse the entire subtree to ensure all references are cleared. In the worst case\n(deleting the root), this visits all N nodes.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: If deleting an internal node also deletes all its descendants, you must traverse the entire subtree to ensure all references are cleared. In the worst case (deleting the root), this visits all N nodes.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "bEYvZ1OC",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: If deleting an internal node also deletes all its descendants, you must traverse the entire subtree to ensure all references are cleared. In the worst case (deleting the root), this visits all N nodes.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
