		{
			"id": "YY1RX3OS",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2813.259104950559,
			"y": 1799.703370095362,
			"width": 967.9989013671875,
			"height": 125,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b1y",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 528241084,
			"version": 606,
			"versionNonce": 853268484,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) (Iterative) or O(H) (Recursive stack)\nExplanation: Because a General Tree is unordered, there is no \"shortcut\" to find a node.\nYou must perform an exhaustive scan of the entire structure. \nIn the worst-case scenario, the target node is the very last leaf visited.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) (Iterative) or O(H) (Recursive stack)\nExplanation: Because a General Tree is unordered, there is no \"shortcut\" to find a node. You must perform an exhaustive scan of the entire structure. \nIn the worst-case scenario, the target node is the very last leaf visited.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "fZ5l0d87",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(N)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) (Iterative) or O(H) (Recursive stack)\nExplanation: Because a General Tree is unordered, there is no \"shortcut\" to find a node. You must perform an exhaustive scan of the entire structure. \nIn the worst-case scenario, the target node is the very last leaf visited.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "hK8ET4lR",
			"type": "rectangle",
			"x": 2808.162385273832,
			"y": 1270.2701176996625,
			"width": 1019.0712533589858,
