			"versionNonce": 1160394628,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Time Complexity: O(1)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: Assuming you already hold a reference to the parent node, adding a child is\nsimply calling parent.children.add(child). This is a constant-time pointer assignment.",
			"rawText": "Time Complexity: O(1)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: Assuming you already hold a reference to the parent node, adding a child is simply calling parent.children.add(child). This is a constant-time pointer assignment.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "hK8ET4lR",
			"originalText": "Time Complexity: O(1)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)\nExplanation: Assuming you already hold a reference to the parent node, adding a child is simply calling parent.children.add(child). This is a constant-time pointer assignment.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "FqZfjtWl",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2803.2601840275383,
			"y": 226.0557960855479,
			"width": 1034.379531497418,
			"height": 50,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "dashed",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "b21",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 283196804,
			"version": 171,
			"versionNonce": 593097404,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783545802171,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Unlike a Linked List (where each node has one next pointer), a General Tree node has a List of\npointers, allowing it to \"branch\" into as many directions as it needs.",
			"rawText": "Unlike a Linked List (where each node has one next pointer), a General Tree node has a List of pointers, allowing it to \"branch\" into as many directions as it needs.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Unlike a Linked List (where each node has one next pointer), a General Tree node has a List of pointers, allowing it to \"branch\" into as many directions as it needs.",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
